n Orlando, Florida. Historically, we operated with a focus on optical component manufacturing, and specifically on our leadership position as a precision molded lens manufacturer for visual light applications.","filed":"2026-09-11","text_path":"text/LPTH/0001437749-26-030106-business.txt","text_chars":26000}}